%% Lab 002 — Revocation propagation
flowchart TD
    P[Parent envelope revoked] --> C1[Child envelope marked invalid]
    C1 --> C2[Grandchild / tool hop invalid]
    C2 --> D[Delegation chain_status: revoked]
    D --> POL[Policy]
    POL --> DENY[DENY parent_revoked]
    DENY --> AUD[Audit evidence]
    DENY --> FB[Fallback: human review / new delegation]
    FB --> NE[New evaluation required]
    NE -.->|never| AUTO[Automatic restore of revoked chain]
